  "sourceFactsVersusModernAdditions": {
    "source": [
      "Five durable source PNGs actually opened; all source hashes match frozen observations.",
      "Graphs have25 bands per direction,24x24 strips; origin col2 row22, x=.5 col12,x=1 col22,y=10 row2; full step dx=.05/dy=.5.",
      "Figure81 has exactly nine filled unconnected first-table dots, no curve/function label.",
      "Figure82 has one smooth solid curve only[0,1], endpoints(0,1),(1,10), no curve arrow or visible point markers.",
      "Figure82 dashed paired guides correspond to source prose approx.37->2.3,.82->6.6 and endpoint1->10; no guide-value labels.",
      "Each table has2 rows/6 columns,3 horizontal rules,5 internal separators,open outer sides.218 has a blank terminal column.",
      "217+218 partition9 source pairs;219 has5 separate refinement pairs; printed fractions,parentheses,decimal trailing zeros retained."
    ],
    "modern": [
      "Straight uniform full strips; short right width.025 and bottom height.3 are deliberate half/three-fifths full-step choices, NOT exact scan fractions.",
      "Four visible grids explicitly model23x23 full cells plus1x23 right,23x1 bottom,1x1 corner; gridDimensions checks each piece.",
      "Source x unit10cm/y unit1cm preserved by10:1 screen scale; an English unit legend is added.",
      "Renderer-owned axis arrowheads,dashes,font/spacing/semantic color roles; scan skew/ink texture not reconstructed.",
      "Figure82 function-sampled tangent cubic svgPath is modern mathematical regularization, NOT restored original control points.",
      "Three source hundredths differ from direct formula rounding: source5.63/4.86/8.65 versus formula5.62/4.87/8.66. Source dots/tables remain unchanged. These are explicit analytic regularization differences, not source errata or exact curve-through-rounded-data claims.",
      "Guide endpoints lie on regularized function at source prose x values;2.3/6.6 remain approximate source readings, not imposed exact equalities.",
      "Open tables use visible4x2 interior grid with gridDimensions plus checked one-column open margins:1+4+1=6. No fake6-column grid claim or added side borders.",
      "English y=10^x row label adds y= to source10^x while keeping function meaning; numerator/denominator labels and bars remain renderer objects."
    ]
  },
